e nipple is a 2 5cm well healed linear scar  Contiguous with the scar is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm hemorrhagic cavity with adjacent fat necrosis which communicates with the black inked deep margin  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan white focally gritty dense white fibrous tissue area which communicates with the biopsy cavity    residual tumor   The remaining parenchyma is 85  dense white fibrous to 15  yellow lobulated fatty tissue  Underlying the axillary tail is minimal tan brown muscle  There are multiple tan red rubbery to tan white firm lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 2 0cm in greatest dimension within the axillary tail  Representative sections are submitted as follows  B F  Biopsy cavity to deep  G  Biopsy cavity to deep with   residual tumor  H  Fibrous tissue away from biopsy cavity  I  4 whole lymph nodes  J  4 whole lymph nodes  K L  1 serially sectioned lymph node  Gross Description by  LORI MARINI Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  FCK      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  SENTINEL NODE  1   LYMPH NODE WITH FOCUS  HIGHLY SUSPICIOUS FOR CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  TAI YUAN LIN  MD O R  Diagnosis by  William C  Faquin MD PhD O R  Consulting Pathologist s   Frederick Carl Koerner  M                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  SENTINEL  1   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY , Absent.
